"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 38.288,
"end": 41.88,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And that connects to what we are discussing today.",
"char_start": 546,
"char_end": 596,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 41.88,
"end": 48.05,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I'd like to point something out – Stefan Brandt mentioned a similar dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 611,
"char_end": 706,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 48.05,
"end": 50.452,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 707,
"char_end": 742,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 50.452,
"end": 53.814,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 743,
"char_end": 792,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 53.814,
"end": 62.041,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 807,
"char_end": 903,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 62.041,
"end": 65.898,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 904,
"char_end": 949,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 65.898,
"end": 70.354,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 950,
"char_end": 1002,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 70.354,
"end": 72.431,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1017,
"char_end": 1050,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 72.431,
"end": 75.516,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1051,
"char_end": 1100,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 75.516,
"end": 76.112,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1115,
"char_end": 1125,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 76.112,
"end": 82.307,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 1126,
"char_end": 1230,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 82.307,
"end": 86.954,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1231,
"char_end": 1309,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 86.954,
"end": 88.239,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1324,
"char_end": 1342,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 88.239,
"end": 91.736,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1343,
"char_end": 1392,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 91.736,
"end": 101.021,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes you can survive.",
"char_start": 1407,
"char_end": 1527,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 101.021,
"end": 104.425,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1528,
"char_end": 1572,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 104.425,
"end": 109.996,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1573,
"char_end": 1645,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 109.996,
"end": 111.469,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where does it break down?",
"char_start": 1660,
"char_end": 1685,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 111.469,
"end": 116.821,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly visible.",
"char_start": 1700,
"char_end": 1776,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 116.821,
"end": 121.469,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 1777,
"char_end": 1843,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 121.469,
"end": 125.378,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic (or guiding principle) that you always come back to?",
"char_start": 1858,
"char_end": 1932,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 125.378,
"end": 127.808,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1933,
"char_end": 1979,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 127.808,
"end": 129.206,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1994,
"char_end": 2014,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 129.206,
"end": 135.708,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 2015,
"char_end": 2108,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 135.708,
"end": 140.252,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions will become easier.",
"char_start": 2109,
"char_end": 2174,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 140.252,
"end": 146.879,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we continue, please support this podcast and visit the website of our sponsor.",
"char_start": 2189,
