"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5044,
"char_end": 5095,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 330.026,
"end": 338.226,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5096,
"char_end": 5201,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 338.226,
"end": 342.209,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5202,
"char_end": 5253,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 342.209,
"end": 346.27,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5254,
"char_end": 5306,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 346.27,
"end": 346.996,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "That fits.\nThat works.\nThat's perfect.\nThat's right.\nThat's a good fit.",
"char_start": 5321,
"char_end": 5392,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 346.996,
"end": 356.645,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And when teams adopt the Spoke & Wrench process, the compromise becomes apparent – I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5407,
"char_end": 5542,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 356.645,
"end": 360.026,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
"char_start": 5557,
"char_end": 5608,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 360.026,
"end": 363.738,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 5609,
"char_end": 5665,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 363.738,
"end": 365.103,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5680,
"char_end": 5700,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 365.103,
"end": 371.449,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 5701,
"char_end": 5794,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 371.449,
"end": 375.134,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5795,
"char_end": 5849,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 375.134,
"end": 380.585,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we wrap up, is there one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 5864,
"char_end": 5939,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 380.585,
"end": 385.986,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 5954,
"char_end": 6022,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 385.986,
"end": 387.734,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The rest is iteration.",
"char_start": 6023,
"char_end": 6045,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 387.734,
"end": 392.098,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "And finally, thank you to our sponsors at Vanta.",
"char_start": 6060,
"char_end": 6108,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 392.098,
"end": 395.825,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Vanta automates SOC 2 and ISO compliance.",
"char_start": 6109,
"char_end": 6150,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 395.825,
"end": 398.007,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Learn more at vanta.com.",
"char_start": 6151,
"char_end": 6175,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 398.007,
"end": 401.0,
